{"id":"084076b1e347ab30","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md","title":"Characteristic Function","display":"df-characteristic-function — Characteristic Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-characteristic-function","aliases":["58-df-characteristic-function","Characteristic Function"],"display":"df-characteristic-function — Characteristic Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-probability]]","[[58-df-random-variable]]","[[58-df-bochner-integral]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-exponential]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-characteristic-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-characteristic-function</span><span>Characteristic Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-characteristic-function — Characteristic Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"49ad0501f11b0cd1\" href=\"?note=49ad0501f11b0cd1\" title=\"58-df-random-variable\">58-df-random-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e0348ed2298c600\" href=\"?note=9e0348ed2298c600\" title=\"58-df-bochner-integral\">58-df-bochner-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"58-df-exponential\">58-df-exponential</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,\\phi\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,\\phi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\">\\(\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"49ad0501f11b0cd1\" href=\"?note=49ad0501f11b0cd1\" title=\"58-df-random-variable\">58-df-random-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(L,f,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\">\\(\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(L,f,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\)</span> (exact complex-valued integral signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9e0348ed2298c600\" href=\"?note=9e0348ed2298c600\" title=\"58-df-bochner-integral\">58-df-bochner-integral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\">\\(\\exp\\)</span> (complex exponential, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"58-df-exponential\">58-df-exponential</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists h_t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(h_t,\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;(h_t(\\xi)=\\exp(i\\,t\\,X(\\xi)))\\land\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(\\phi(t),h_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C),\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},|\\cdot|)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists h_t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(h_t,\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;(h_t(\\xi)=\\exp(i\\,t\\,X(\\xi)))\\land\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(\\phi(t),h_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C),\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},|\\cdot|)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Characteristic function: Fourier transform of distribution</li>\n<li>The Bochner-integral call now preserves all eleven source arguments and their order.</li>\n<li>Bochner's theorem: positive definite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Leftrightarrow\">\\(\\Leftrightarrow\\)</span> characteristic of probability measure</li>\n<li>Lévy: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_X\">\\(\\phi_X\\)</span> continuous <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow X\">\\(\\Rightarrow X\\)</span> distribution uniquely determined</li>\n<li>Inversion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(x) = \\frac{1}{2\\pi} \\int e^{-itx}\\phi(t)dt\">\\(F(x) = \\frac{1}{2\\pi} \\int e^{-itx}\\phi(t)dt\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Billingsley, Probability and Measure</li>\n<li>Durrett, Probability: Theory and Examples</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"49ad0501f11b0cd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-random-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bochner-integral","status":"resolved","id":"9e0348ed2298c600","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bochner-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-exponential]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)$ (see [[58-df-probability]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"49ad0501f11b0cd1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))$ (see [[58-df-random-variable]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bochner-integral","status":"resolved","id":"9e0348ed2298c600","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(L,f,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)$ (exact complex-valued integral signature, see [[58-df-bochner-integral]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\exp$ (complex exponential, see [[58-df-exponential]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,\\phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(L,f,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,E,\\mathcal E,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S(\\phi,X;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{RandomVariable}_S(X;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists h_t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(h_t,\\Omega,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;(h_t(\\xi)=\\exp(i\\,t\\,X(\\xi)))\\land\\mathrm{BochnerIntegral}_S(\\phi(t),h_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C),\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},|\\cdot|)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow X","display":false},{"tex":"F(x) = \\frac{1}{2\\pi} \\int e^{-itx}\\phi(t)dt","display":false}],"bytes":2212,"backlinks":[{"id":"34a7e79edd9f7f6e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"35044454ad233373","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CharacteristicFunction}_S$ (特征函数谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md]])"},{"id":"cbddf9eabf158853","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-269","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-characteristic-function.md|58-df-characteristic-function]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5e0db065132180df","49ad0501f11b0cd1","9e0348ed2298c600","36d7463d215be751","689fa138a0ce2d6c"]}